WEBVTT

00:02:04.124 --> 00:02:07.992
--Nomura! Don't!
--Stop, Nomura!

00:02:11.899 --> 00:02:13.594
What's with him?!

00:02:17.137 --> 00:02:19.469
It's started...!

00:02:41.962 --> 00:02:43.673
Don't tell me he's--

00:02:43.697 --> 00:02:47.611
--The return of...
--...Gaia, the super soldier!

00:02:47.635 --> 00:02:49.228
Beware!

00:02:51.605 --> 00:02:52.766
Gaia?!

00:02:54.008 --> 00:02:59.674
"Gaia”

00:03:02.449 --> 00:03:08.765
--Where'd you get those?!
--Gaia gave 'em to me long ago.

00:03:08.789 --> 00:03:12.569
--You fought Gaia?!
--One win after another...

00:03:12.593 --> 00:03:17.240
All my victories got to the head
of this 'soldier among soldiers',

00:03:17.264 --> 00:03:23.431
and I foolishly chose to fight
Gaia one-on-one in the jungle!

00:03:33.781 --> 00:03:38.028
Mister War- also known as Gaia.

00:03:38.052 --> 00:03:41.164
Not even a nuclear missile
could stop him.

00:03:41.188 --> 00:03:45.802
Only one man could possibly
take him on... the Ogre.

00:03:45.826 --> 00:03:48.557
Yujiro Hanma!

00:03:50.331 --> 00:03:54.644
So this boy is our enemy.

00:03:54.668 --> 00:03:59.316
The son of the Ogre, Yujiro Hanma, huh?

00:03:59.340 --> 00:04:02.285
Just like your father,
you're a mere amateur.

00:04:02.309 --> 00:04:04.955
--What did you say?!
--The Ogre is indeed strong.

00:04:04.979 --> 00:04:09.926
But as he fights for his
own enjoyment, he is no pro.

00:04:09.950 --> 00:04:15.665
We are pros. Professional soldiers,
who kill out of duty.

00:04:15.689 --> 00:04:17.767
Pros...?

00:04:17.791 --> 00:04:20.103
Soldiers aren't like fighters.

00:04:20.127 --> 00:04:22.772
We don't fight for personal
reasons such as pride

00:04:22.796 --> 00:04:24.641
or the desire to beat others.

00:04:24.665 --> 00:04:28.545
But given the order,
we will fight- and win.

00:04:28.569 --> 00:04:31.581
By any means necessary.

00:04:31.605 --> 00:04:33.016
Think you're so tough!

00:04:33.040 --> 00:04:37.420
They all said you rival Yujiro Hanma,
so I thought you'd be a beast.

00:04:37.444 --> 00:04:40.971
To think the guy whose ass
| kicked last night was Gaia...

00:04:42.049 --> 00:04:45.110
| won't let you off so easy this time!

00:05:03.937 --> 00:05:05.371
I'm not hitting him...!

00:05:12.346 --> 00:05:16.359
That's right. I'm not the
Nomura you beat last night.

00:05:16.383 --> 00:05:19.162
I'm another personality inside of him.

00:05:19.186 --> 00:05:21.678
The other face of
his split personality.

00:05:23.824 --> 00:05:25.869
I am Gaia!

00:05:25.893 --> 00:05:28.238
Split personality...?

00:05:28.262 --> 00:05:29.706
Poor boy.

00:05:29.730 --> 00:05:34.531
I'll show you how foolish it
is to defy Gaia, the earth god.

00:05:40.574 --> 00:05:45.055
I'm controlling the
flow of my adrenaline.

00:05:45.079 --> 00:05:46.990
Adrenaline...

00:05:47.014 --> 00:05:49.592
Adrenal medulla yr hormones...

00:05:49.616 --> 00:05:53.396
They suppress pain and blood loss,
increase heart contraction,

00:05:53.420 --> 00:05:56.166
and raise blood sugar levels.

00:05:56.190 --> 00:05:59.469
Sounds just like endorphins...

00:05:59.493 --> 00:06:02.305
What controls the minds
and bodies of living beings

00:06:02.329 --> 00:06:05.408
are the chemicals secreted
throughout the body.

00:06:05.432 --> 00:06:09.813
By being able to fully control those,
| have surpassed humans.

00:06:09.837 --> 00:06:12.215
In short, I am a god!

00:06:12.239 --> 00:06:15.903
No one would dare defy a god.

00:06:17.111 --> 00:06:19.205
Now come!

00:06:23.183 --> 00:06:25.328
You just don't learn.

00:06:25.352 --> 00:06:27.218
Got ya!

00:06:28.322 --> 00:06:30.256
You're no god!

00:06:32.960 --> 00:06:35.793
Impudent heathen!

00:06:38.265 --> 00:06:40.529
Return to the earth!

00:06:50.010 --> 00:06:53.605
Adrenaline draws out a
person's latent potential.

00:06:55.983 --> 00:07:00.420
Allow me to show you a
miracle by controlling it.

00:07:09.096 --> 00:07:10.996
He's not human...!

00:07:21.341 --> 00:07:27.157
If I felt so inclined, I could easily
break every sports record out there.

00:07:27.181 --> 00:07:31.394
So what? If you really are
as strong as Yujiro Hanma,

00:07:31.418 --> 00:07:33.296
| wouldn't expect any less.

00:07:33.320 --> 00:07:36.813
But I refuse to lose!

00:07:45.365 --> 00:07:50.030
Have you ever smashed
into the ground at 80 kph?

00:07:51.839 --> 00:07:56.470
The shock is equivalent
to falling seven stories!

00:08:00.948 --> 00:08:02.541
Beware!

00:08:08.088 --> 00:08:11.581
But the ground isn't
what's really scary.

00:08:15.362 --> 00:08:21.211
Do you know how water acts
when you hit it at 80 kph?

00:08:21.235 --> 00:08:24.068
It acts as hard as concrete.

00:08:44.925 --> 00:08:47.587
Mission complete! Move out!

00:09:15.055 --> 00:09:16.648
He can still move...2?!

00:09:21.495 --> 00:09:23.206
Endorphins, huh?

00:09:23.230 --> 00:09:26.342
They're secreted when
pain surpasses its limit.

00:09:26.366 --> 00:09:30.146
Its uplifting sensation
removes all pain,

00:09:30.170 --> 00:09:34.573
and provides the body
with enhanced abilities.

00:09:35.542 --> 00:09:37.738
The Ogre's son, huh?

00:09:41.248 --> 00:09:43.876
He jumped out of water
that was up to his chest!

00:09:50.824 --> 00:09:53.452
He dodged it! After his fist connected!

00:10:13.046 --> 00:10:15.058
That should've hit you!

00:10:15.082 --> 00:10:20.129
No. Your attacks cannot touch me.

00:10:20.153 --> 00:10:21.931
Do you know why?

00:10:21.955 --> 00:10:26.290
Because your body is actually
helping me and not you.

00:10:27.728 --> 00:10:31.892
My body isn't on my side...?

00:10:33.000 --> 00:10:36.436
Are you even certain that your arms
and legs are moving as you want?

00:10:43.410 --> 00:10:46.556
I'll keep at it until I do hit you!

00:10:46.580 --> 00:10:48.691
Stop it!

00:10:48.715 --> 00:10:51.594
How long are you going
to make your body suffer?!

00:10:51.618 --> 00:10:53.596
What...?

00:10:53.620 --> 00:10:56.766
Take a look at yourself!

00:10:56.790 --> 00:11:01.604
Innumerable scars...
Unnaturally developed muscles...

00:11:01.628 --> 00:11:07.677
Proof that you've made your
body suffer for over 10 years.

00:11:07.701 --> 00:11:13.116
You've justified hurting it with
your selfish desire to grow stronger.

00:11:13.140 --> 00:11:17.120
Your uncommon muscles,
speed, and techniques.

00:11:17.144 --> 00:11:20.790
Is that really what your body wanted?

00:11:20.814 --> 00:11:27.764
You got them by continually
ignoring its desire for rest.

00:11:27.788 --> 00:11:32.735
Listen closely to the message
trillions of your cells are screaming.

00:11:32.759 --> 00:11:37.390
They cry out that you've followed
your uncaring soul for too long!

00:11:51.478 --> 00:11:56.325
All I've done is make
this body suffer...?

00:11:56.349 --> 00:11:59.195
Look at my body.

00:11:59.219 --> 00:12:02.331
The minimum amount of muscle needed.

00:12:02.355 --> 00:12:05.768
My adrenaline draws out its strength.

00:12:05.792 --> 00:12:08.771
A natural body, filled with compassion.

00:12:08.795 --> 00:12:11.974
I've never given myself pain as you have.

00:12:11.998 --> 00:12:17.447
Let me tell you how I came
to be Gaia, the super soldier.

00:12:17.471 --> 00:12:20.416
It was five years ago.
| was training as a mercenary

00:12:20.440 --> 00:12:25.776
when I had my first taste of
real combat in a certain country.

00:12:28.148 --> 00:12:32.028
I learned of the delicious
drink known as 'killing'.

00:12:32.052 --> 00:12:36.785
Eventually, I took great
risks just to taste it.

00:12:40.627 --> 00:12:42.459
A mercenary, huh?

00:12:44.231 --> 00:12:47.166
| was to be executed immediately.

00:12:49.936 --> 00:12:51.914
Good night, kid.

00:12:51.938 --> 00:12:53.497
Three!

00:12:54.341 --> 00:12:57.420
The fear of having hundreds
of guns pointed at me...

00:12:57.444 --> 00:13:00.723
The thought of certain death...

00:13:00.747 --> 00:13:02.225
Two!

00:13:02.249 --> 00:13:05.528
In one second, I will die!

00:13:05.552 --> 00:13:10.533
That truth sharpened
my senses to their limits!

00:13:10.557 --> 00:13:11.367
One!

00:13:11.391 --> 00:13:13.836
That's when it happened!

00:13:13.860 --> 00:13:17.440
Something powerful hit my body!

00:13:17.464 --> 00:13:21.344
Murderous intent, bloodlust...
It has many names...

00:13:21.368 --> 00:13:24.747
The feeling just before you take action!

00:13:24.771 --> 00:13:30.437
That feeling was concentrated
100-fold by my sharpened senses!

00:13:31.344 --> 00:13:34.657
And the shots never came-

00:13:34.681 --> 00:13:37.651
my allies saved me in the nick of time.

00:13:39.152 --> 00:13:43.453
The fear had been so great
that I lost all my hair...

00:13:45.091 --> 00:13:51.407
After this incident, my intuition
for danger became supernatural.

00:13:51.431 --> 00:13:55.077
When faced with danger,
my other personality would appear,

00:13:55.101 --> 00:13:58.247
and I would become Gaia!

00:13:58.271 --> 00:14:02.552
Exercises? Training?
| had no need for such things.

00:14:02.576 --> 00:14:06.789
| could predict my enemy's
attacks and control my adrenaline

00:14:06.813 --> 00:14:08.925
to strengthen my muscles.

00:14:08.949 --> 00:14:13.696
Your mind tells me about
all of your attacks.

00:14:13.720 --> 00:14:17.384
It's over! I can't possibly
beat this guy...!

00:14:18.925 --> 00:14:21.758
Let me free your body!

00:14:33.273 --> 00:14:34.536
I'm feeling it...!

00:14:36.376 --> 00:14:39.243
Does my body want to be freed...?!

00:14:40.880 --> 00:14:45.113
Even though it's my own body,
I'm really giving it a beating...!

00:14:48.888 --> 00:14:52.201
What a kick! I'm done for...

00:14:52.225 --> 00:14:54.971
I'm a goner if it hits me...

00:14:54.995 --> 00:14:57.760
I'tl let my body be free...

00:15:03.036 --> 00:15:04.547
--He hit-
-- -Gaia!

00:15:04.571 --> 00:15:06.596
--No way!
--Never seen that before!

00:15:09.109 --> 00:15:11.687
My body...

00:15:11.711 --> 00:15:13.789
...is reacting by itself!

00:15:13.813 --> 00:15:18.410
My body is doing attacks by itself
that it's done thousands of times!

00:15:23.123 --> 00:15:25.490
These don't betray me...!

00:15:26.559 --> 00:15:31.224
My mind has surrendered to you.
But my body rejects you!

00:15:32.365 --> 00:15:34.910
I see. Unconscious attacks.

00:15:34.934 --> 00:15:38.131
That would prevent me from
reading his combative spirit.

00:15:40.874 --> 00:15:46.210
But now that he's cognizant again,
I can see all of his attacks!

00:15:51.518 --> 00:15:54.180
Predictions don't amount to crap now!

00:16:12.872 --> 00:16:14.840
I can't afford to be defensive!

00:16:20.347 --> 00:16:24.944
--A five-point handstand landing!
--He reduced the total shock!

00:16:28.922 --> 00:16:30.287
He hit him again!

00:16:38.064 --> 00:16:41.677
Thanks to my
unnaturally-developed muscles,

00:16:41.701 --> 00:16:44.363
| can stay this energetic!

00:16:49.743 --> 00:16:54.510
--He's gonna do it!
--Wait! What about us...?!

00:16:58.084 --> 00:17:00.451
More adrenalin?!

00:17:22.242 --> 00:17:27.056
In ancient Indian yoga, by acquiring
a special form of breathing,

00:17:27.080 --> 00:17:31.527
it is possible to store much
more air in the lungs than normal.

00:17:31.551 --> 00:17:35.297
It would take an entire day
to expend that air.

00:17:35.321 --> 00:17:38.734
However, by vibrating
the vocal cords with it,

00:17:38.758 --> 00:17:40.522
it becomes a weapon.

00:17:49.302 --> 00:17:53.416
--He's hitting himself!
--To keep himself conscious!

00:17:53.440 --> 00:17:54.805
Fool!

00:18:12.826 --> 00:18:14.590
He felt that, alright!

00:18:20.133 --> 00:18:21.210
Water bullets?!

00:18:21.234 --> 00:18:25.262
| told you before! Pros will do
whatever it takes to win!

00:18:29.375 --> 00:18:31.554
A knife?!

00:18:31.578 --> 00:18:35.324
| can't beat the Ogre just
by controlling my adrenaline.

00:18:35.348 --> 00:18:39.028
But what if I used my entire
environment to my advantage?

00:18:39.052 --> 00:18:44.957
What if I used the grass, trees,
earth, water, wind, and everything?!

00:18:53.366 --> 00:18:54.492
A vine attack?!

00:19:01.841 --> 00:19:05.521
--These are-
--Gaia's battlefield techniques...!

00:19:05.545 --> 00:19:08.290
Are you trying to
completely annihilate him?!

00:19:08.314 --> 00:19:11.545
It's unfortunate that I have
to destroy such a body...

00:19:13.987 --> 00:19:16.251
---but I must end this!

00:19:24.998 --> 00:19:28.093
This is all the Ogre's son has?

00:19:36.009 --> 00:19:42.176
--Why won't you die?!
- I don't spoil my body like you!

00:19:43.716 --> 00:19:46.686
Why...2!

00:19:53.660 --> 00:19:57.406
Surprise attacks! Foul play!

00:19:57.430 --> 00:20:00.400
Using weapons against unarmed opponents!

00:20:09.642 --> 00:20:13.306
Maybe you really are the
strongest person on the battlefield.

00:20:15.415 --> 00:20:21.513
Here's a compassion-filled attack
that doesn't hurt the body!

00:20:24.357 --> 00:20:26.689
He blocked his jugular!

00:20:53.519 --> 00:20:56.386
--Captain!
--Captain!

00:21:02.795 --> 00:21:06.809
I see. I lost...

00:21:06.833 --> 00:21:10.531
Mission's over. We failed.

00:21:11.404 --> 00:21:13.202
Um...

00:21:14.474 --> 00:21:17.569
Want some grub, kid?

00:21:19.445 --> 00:21:21.690
I thought as much...

00:21:21.714 --> 00:21:23.525
I'd love some!

00:21:23.549 --> 00:21:26.280
There's nothing to say to a loser!

00:21:31.090 --> 00:21:32.534
Smell good?

00:21:32.558 --> 00:21:36.620
Sorry. I haven't eaten since I got here.

00:21:38.231 --> 00:21:40.275
Seems pretty beat up.

00:21:40.299 --> 00:21:42.768
A gift from a war buddy.

00:21:52.011 --> 00:21:58.293
Gaia-san. Nomura-san.
Sanada-san. Kuraishi-san. Chiba-san.

00:21:58.317 --> 00:22:01.116
I'tl never forget you!

00:22:44.864 --> 00:22:50.412
The hazy afternoon in the winter sun

00:22:50.436 --> 00:22:56.018
hangs onto love in one
corner of the pavement

00:22:56.042 --> 00:23:01.690
When I blew on my cold hands

00:23:01.714 --> 00:23:06.695
a tiny bit of courage swelled up.

00:23:06.719 --> 00:23:12.234
Today will certainly be wonderful,

00:23:12.258 --> 00:23:17.773
gently enveloped in love

00:23:17.797 --> 00:23:23.445
There are some strange feelings too,

00:23:23.469 --> 00:23:28.984
but they will be reborn

00:23:29.008 --> 00:23:34.656
Today will certainly be wonderful;

00:23:34.680 --> 00:23:40.778
they will be reborn as even more love.

00:23:50.163 --> 00:23:51.961
"Next Episode”

00:23:54.867 --> 00:23:56.345
One week left.

00:23:56.369 --> 00:24:01.517
He's improved and gained
scars for this day.

00:24:01.541 --> 00:24:08.690
The boy takes on yet another challenge
to outclass a skilled blade.

00:24:08.714 --> 00:24:14.997
He asks once again, "Why do I fight?
What do I fight for?”

00:24:15.021 --> 00:24:19.925
"Next Episode: Bite Marks"
